@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Afsender EUA" as Sender
participant "EER\n(FHIR Endpoint Register)" as EER
participant "EHMI Access Point\n/ MSH" as EHMI
participant "Mapningskomponent\n(EHMI / VANS)" as Map
participant "Modtager VANS" as VANS
actor "Modtager EUA\n(OIOXML)" as Receiver

== 1. Opslag af offentlig kapabilitet ==
Sender -> EER : GET /Endpoint?identifier=gs1.org/gln|5790001234567
activate EER
EER --> Sender : Returnerer Public Endpoint\n(EHMI AP, FHIR CareCommunication)
deactivate EER

== 2. Afsendelse via EHMI ==
Sender -> EHMI : Sender FHIR Bundle (ehmiSBDH + AS4)
activate EHMI

== 3. Opslag af reel EUA-kapabilitet ==
EHMI -> EER : GET /Endpoint?identifier=eua-gln|5790001234567
activate EER
EER --> EHMI : Returnerer EUA Target Endpoint\n(VANS, OIOXML DIS91)
deactivate EER

== 4. Mapning og aflevering ==
EHMI -> Map : Overdrager FHIR Bundle + Target Profile (DIS91)
deactivate EHMI
activate Map
Map -> Map : Konverterer FHIR -> OIOXML + VANSEnvelope
Map -> VANS : Afleverer OIOXML besked til GLN 5790001234567
deactivate Map
activate VANS
VANS -> Receiver : Henter OIOXML i lokal postkasse
deactivate VANS

== 5. Kvitteringsflow (CTL / Acknowledgement) ==
activate Receiver
Receiver -> VANS : Sender OIOXML Positiv/Negativ Kvittering (CTL)
deactivate Receiver
activate VANS
VANS -> Map : Videresender OIOXML CTL
deactivate VANS
activate Map
Map -> Map : Konverterer OIOXML CTL -> FHIR Acknowledgement
Map -> EHMI : Sender FHIR Ack via AS4/ehmiSBDH
deactivate Map
activate EHMI
EHMI -> Sender : Modtager FHIR kvittering i oprindeligt format
deactivate EHMI

@enduml
